    "notes": "Only the explicitly labeled dify-extension-canary workload is disposable. IO, time, queue, and connection-pool extensions are eligible there after runtime preflight; ordinary Dify workloads remain protected. JVM extension is selected only when runtime inventory discovers a Java process."
